<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia trader Emona Obala to be listed on Monday.</title>
<headline>Slovenia trader Emona Obala to be listed on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian trading company Emona Obala Koper will be listed on the over-the-counter (OTC) market of the Ljubljana bourse on April 28, the Ljubljana Stock Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the company will list 1,590,783 shares with a nominal value of 1,000 tolars each, representing 91.35 percent of the firm's equity. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
